graph TD
    %% Pre-mRNA Structure
    A[Pre-mRNA Transcript] --> B[5' Exon]
    A --> C[Intron with Splice Sites]
    A --> D[3' Exon]
    
    C --> E[5' Splice Site GU]
    C --> F[Branch Point Adenosine]
    C --> G[3' Splice Site AG]
    
    %% E Complex Assembly
    E --> H[U1 snRNP Recognition]
    H --> I[U1 snRNA Base Pairing]
    I --> J{AND: U1-70K<br/>AND Snu71?}
    J -->|No| K[E Complex Fails]
    J -->|Yes| L[E Complex Formed]
    
    %% A Complex Assembly
    F --> M[BBP Protein Binding]
    M --> N[Branch Point Recognition]
    N --> O[U2 snRNP Recruitment]
    
    O --> P{AND: SF3a<br/>AND SF3b?}
    P -->|No| K
    P -->|Yes| Q[U2 snRNA-Branch Point Pairing]
    
    Q --> R{AND: Prp5<br/>ATPase?}
    R -->|No| K
    R -->|Yes| S[A Complex Formed]
    
    %% U4/U6.U5 Tri-snRNP Recruitment
    S --> T[U4/U6.U5 Tri-snRNP]
    T --> U{AND: U4 + U6<br/>Base-Paired?}
    U -->|No| V[Tri-snRNP Unstable]
    U -->|Yes| W[Stable Tri-snRNP]
    
    W --> X{AND: Prp8<br/>Scaffold Present?}
    X -->|No| V
    X -->|Yes| Y[Tri-snRNP Recruitment]
    
    Y --> Z[B Complex Assembly]
    
    %% Catalytic Activation
    Z --> AA[Prp28 Helicase]
    AA --> AB[U1 snRNP Displaced]
    AB --> AC[U6 snRNA Replaces U1]
    
    AC --> AD[Brr2 Helicase]
    AD --> AE[U4/U6 Unwinding]
    AE --> AF[U4 snRNP Released]
    AF --> AG[U6 snRNA Freed]
    
    AG --> AH{AND: U6 + U2<br/>Catalytic Core?}
    AH -->|No| AI[No Catalysis]
    AH -->|Yes| AJ[Bact Complex Formed]
    
    %% Metal Ion Coordination
    AJ --> AK{AND: Mg2+ Ions<br/>Coordinated?}
    AK -->|No| AI
    AK -->|Yes| AL[Active Site Configuration]
    
    %% Step 1: Branch Point Attack
    AL --> AM[Branch Point 2'OH]
    AM --> AN[Nucleophilic Attack on 5' SS]
    AN --> AO[Phosphodiester Bond Cleavage]
    AO --> AP[5' Exon Released]
    AP --> AQ[Intron-3' Exon Lariat]
    
    AQ --> AR{AND: Branch-5'SS<br/>2'-5' Linkage?}
    AR -->|No| AS[Splicing Error]
    AR -->|Yes| AT[Lariat Intermediate]
    
    %% Spliceosome Rearrangement
    AT --> AU[Prp16 Helicase]
    AU --> AV[Prp16 ATP Hydrolysis]
    AV --> AW[B→C Complex Transition]
    AW --> AX[C Complex Active]
    
    %% Step 2: Exon Ligation
    AX --> AY[5' Exon 3'OH]
    AY --> AZ[Nucleophilic Attack on 3' SS]
    AZ --> BA[3' Splice Site Cleavage]
    BA --> BB[Exon Ligation]
    
    BB --> BC{AND: Exons<br/>Joined?}
    BC -->|No| AS
    BC -->|Yes| BD[Ligated mRNA]
    BD --> BE[Lariat Intron Released]
    
    %% Spliceosome Disassembly
    BE --> BF[Prp22 Helicase]
    BF --> BG[mRNA Released]
    BG --> BH[Prp43 Helicase]
    BH --> BI[snRNP Disassembly]
    
    %% snRNP Recycling
    BI --> BJ{OR: Which<br/>snRNP?}
    BJ -->|U2| BK[U2 Recycled]
    BJ -->|U5| BL[U5 Recycled]
    BJ -->|U6| BM[U6 Recycled]
    
    BK --> BN[snRNP Regeneration]
    BL --> BN
    BM --> BN
    BN --> BO[Ready for Next Round]
    
    %% Lariat Debranching
    BE --> BP[Dbr1 Debranching Enzyme]
    BP --> BQ[Lariat → Linear Intron]
    BQ --> BR[/Exonucleolytic Degradation/]
    BR --> BS[Nucleotides Recycled]
    
    %% mRNA Export
    BG --> BT[Exon Junction Complex]
    BT --> BU{AND: CBC<br/>AND TREX?}
    BU -->|No| BV[Export Defect]
    BU -->|Yes| BW[mRNA Export]
    BW --> BX[Nuclear Export]
    BX --> BY(\1)
    BY --> BZ([Protein Production])
    
    %% Quality Control
    AS --> CA[NMD Pathway]
    CA --> CB[/Degraded/]
    AI --> CB
    K --> CB
    V --> CB
    
